"whiphand  /home/dev/shop  · Runs  (experimental)                                "
"┌ Runs ─┌ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐───────┐"
"│Workflo│Runs                                                          │Elapsed│"
"│feature│  /             filter                                        │5m 0s  │"
"│cycle  │  n             new run                                       │9m 30s │"
"│bugfix │  m             answer the step waiting on you                │1h 2m  │"
"│feature│  o             ongoing runs in every workspace               │42s    │"
"│       │  c             cancel the run                                │       │"
"│       │  r             resume the run                                │       │"
"│       │  R             rename the run                                │       │"
"│       │  L             lock or unlock the run                        │       │"
"│       │  x             delete the run                                │       │"
"│       │                                                              │       │"
"│       │Everywhere                                                    │       │"
"│       │  ?             this help                                     │       │"
"│       │  q Esc         back; quit from the first screen              │       │"
"│       │  Q             quit                                          │       │"
"│       │  Ctrl-c        cancel the run in focus, else quit            │       │"
"│       │  g             go to a screen (then w, r or d)               │       │"
"│       │  j ↓           down                                          │       │"
"│       │  k ↑           up                                            │       │"
"│       │  PgDn Ctrl-d   page down                                     │       │"
"└───────└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘───────┘"
" / filter  ·  n new run  ·  m answer the step waiting on you  ·  o ongoing runs "
